    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61091b9de883dc1992f97171",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你们的梦想……你们『爱』的结晶，我很期待。\n幼小的爱，盛开，结果——会结出怎样的果实呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a120e5f6f9b3bbd1a3dd74355b47f9d669b17ba948b12ba63293467d0c75420",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
